%% title: Roll out a host change, one node at a time
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CI as CI
    participant C as binary cache
    participant S as estate-kit service
    participant O as ghcr
    participant A as host applier
    participant K as API server
    CI->>C: push signed closures
    CI->>CI: VM test per node class
    CI->>S: host rollout (GitHub OIDC token)
    S->>O: move host/#lt#59;node#gt#59;:prod
    A->>O: poll the tag, verify it
    A->>C: fetch the closure
    A->>K: take the Lease, evict pods
    A->>A: switch#59; reboot only inside the window
    A->>K: uncordon, release the Lease
